le.com/engagement-rings/design-your-own-ring/tapered-cathedral-solitaire-engagement-ring-in-14k-yellow-gold-item-203288?a_aid=69d7c31a91b8d&a_cid=55e51e63&chan=blog-informational">Cathedral Solitaire YG $1,240</a></td><td><strong>$4,865</strong></td><td>Yellow gold cathedral arch — elevated, Art Deco, 1.84ct</td></tr></tbody></table>

