, vintage detail, under $4K</td></tr><tr><td><a href="https://www.bluenile.com/diamond-details/27991043?a_aid=69d7c31a91b8d&a_cid=55e51e63&chan=blog-informational">IGI 1.52ct D-IF</a></td><td>D-IF Ideal</td><td><a href="https://www.bluenile.com/diamond-details/27991043?a_aid=69d7c31a91b8d&a_cid=55e51e63&chan=blog-informational">$2,795</a></td><td><a href="https://www.bluenile.com/engagement-rings/design-your-own-ring/art-deco-inspired-fleur-de-lis-pave-vintage-style-engagement-ring-in-14k-rose-gold-by-james-allen-item-315297?a_aid=69d7c31a91b8d&a_cid=55e51e63&chan=blog-informational">Art Deco Fleur RG</a></td><td><a href="https://www.bluenile.com/engagement-rings/design-your-own-ring/art-deco-inspired-fleur-de-lis-pave-vintage-style-engagement-ring-in-14k-rose-gold-by-james-allen-item-315297?a_aid=69d7c31a91b8d&a_cid=55e51e63&chan=blog-informational">$1,190</a></td><td><strong>$3,985</strong></td><td>Rose gold version — same stone, warmer metal, same total</td></tr><tr><td><a href="https://www.bluenile.com/diamond-details/27991043?a_aid=69d7c31a91b8d&a_cid=55e51e63&chan=blog-informational">IGI 1.52ct D-IF</a></td><td>D-IF Ideal</td><td><a href="https://www.bluenile.com/diamond-details/27991043?a_aid=69d7c31a91b8d&a_cid=55e51e63&chan=blog-informational">$2,795</a></td><td><a href="https://www.bluenile.com/engagement-rings/design-your-own-ring/tapered-cathedral-solitaire-engagement-ring-in-14k-yellow-gold-item-203288?a_aid=69d7c31a91b8d&a_cid=55e51e63&chan=blog-informational">Cathedral Solitaire YG</a></td><td><a href="https://www.bluenile.com/engagement-rings/design-your-own-ring/tapered-cathedral-solitaire-engagement-ring-in-14k-yellow-gold-item-203288?a_aid=69d7c31a91b8d&a_cid=55e51e63&chan=blog-informational">$1,240</a></td><td><strong>$4,035</strong></td><td>Cathedral arch in yellow gold — formal, elevated, Art Deco</td></tr><tr><td><a href="https://www.bluenile.com/diamond-details/28929410?a_aid=69d7c31a91b8d&a_cid=55e51e63&chan=blog-informational">IGI 1.84ct D-